"artifact-mods\t瓦解能量球\t女王兰香炉 （终愿）":"\n<p>拾取<span class=\"orb\">能量球</span>或投掷<span class=\"el-strand\">缠结</span>时：</p>\n<p>获得<span class=\"deb-strand\">瓦解弹药</span>，持续 14 <span class=\"unsure\">[?]</span> 秒。</p>\n",
